:"宋褧","text":"南条山色翠微茫，映带江城冠楚乡。\n杨柳两街多大宅，好教留待段文昌。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8430,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送陈亨甫如湖南","author":"宋褧","text":"莫为功名怨别离，别离何用送行诗。\n沅江腊月无杨柳，聊折梅花赠一枝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8431,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵赋春词三首 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"象口香消冷瑞烟，锦衾罗荐任朝眠。\n一心要续怀春梦，不管啼莺绕槛前。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8432,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵赋春词三首 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"妆楼淡月转廊腰，晴露和春浸碧桃。\n爱品凤箫腔未稳，夜天空望彩云高。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8433,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵赋春词三首 其三","author":"宋褧","text":"娇春杨柳暗藏鸦，掩映文窗一树花。\n寒食清明都过了，悄无车马问侬家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8434,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"澧阳道中春日","author":"宋褧","text":"隔村山鸟学绵蛮，夹路溪泉响佩环。\n晴日烘人透衣暖，不须春酒亦酡颜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8435,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"别武陵诸友分韵得身字（延祐己未三月晦日别武陵北归）","author":"宋褧","text":"人别江南花别春，莺莺燕燕总伤神。\n旗亭酒软歌姬艳，争奈相如是病人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8436,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"别后寄友","author":"宋褧","text":"兰舟三日屈原亭，醉出南门缓辔行。\n柳暗河街新月上，一场离恨不分明。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8437,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"舟中夜雨奇周子善","author":"宋褧","text":"雨暗空江夜寂寥，打篷声似打芭蕉。\n故人好在纱窗下，高拥银灯对小乔。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8438,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"漂母墓","author":"宋褧","text":"南昌亭长木兰僧，进食英雄岂不能。\n澼絖家资消几许，阿婆高冢碧崚嶒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8439,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"沛中","author":"宋褧","text":"未央宫阙锦辉煌，隆准何心恋故乡。\n直到中兴守家法，年年供顿幸南阳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8440,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"晚兴","author":"宋褧","text":"紫陌归来月魄新，草深凉院掩柴门。\n絺衣欲挂梧桐上，惭愧缁尘染树痕。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8441,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"感怀","author":"宋褧","text":"扰扰红尘世态殊，少年空殢五车书。\n才情纵解吟春草，毕竟京师不易居。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8442,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"初至都书金城坊所僦屋壁","author":"宋褧","text":"士龙东头士衡西，长沙舞袖难旋转。\n豪家尽有厦连云，自是诗人嫌日短。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8443,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"晚出都城（是年八月东之乐亭县）","author":"宋褧","text":"风入秋罗半臂寒，紫霞赤气日光殷。\n西山大是无情思，忍送巾车又出关。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8444,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宿错桥","author":"宋褧","text":"胡来城下错桥西，神树栖鸦迫暮啼。\n数骑东来饮河水，一声羌管碧云低。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8445,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"渔阳（二首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"万马纷纷动鼓鼙，三郎束手翠华西。\n向来别有销兵策，莫恨青闱燕子泥。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8446,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"渔阳（二首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"小丑从渠怨忌多，不知和解欲如何。\n万几尽有关心处，却办城东热洛河。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8447,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"诚夫兄寄都下杂诗五首（次韵奉答予时在乐亭县） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"虎豹环宫守日旗，夔龙鹄立捲班迟。\n明良自有赓歌咏，逢掖诸生莫献诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8448,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"诚夫兄寄都下杂诗五首（次韵奉答予时在乐亭县） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"凤吹龙筝楼上头，市中沽酒会英游。\n狂心似火何时遂，定约春风赋御沟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8449,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"诚夫兄寄都下杂诗五首（次韵奉答予时在乐亭县） 其三","author":"宋褧","text":"玉皇端拱白云乡，扣额何时上绿章。\n威凤祥麟都网尽，后人谁更说昭王。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8450,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"诚夫兄寄都下杂诗五首（次韵奉答予时在乐亭县） 其四","author":"宋褧","text":"拥被巴童似猬拳，矮窗炉火夜深然。\n风流张绪如杨柳，却向荒寒度半年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8451,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"诚夫兄寄都下杂诗五首（次韵奉答予时在乐亭县） 其五","author":"宋褧","text":"碎霜斜舞下遥天，透胆寒威折塞绵。\n不似豪儿衣狐白，读书辛苦谩多年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8452,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"忆武陵旧事（三首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"咏归亭瞰武陵溪，隔岸花开雨后齐。\n竹筱庄园春社散，青陵村外目平西。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8453,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"忆武陵旧事（三首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"芙蓉如妓绕横塘，一段秋容著色妆。\n犹记周郎会心处，醒时双陆醉时狂。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8454,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"忆武陵旧事（三首） 其三","author":"宋褧","text":"两袖东风脸似霞，满怀红刺访侬家。\n春莺错唱清平调，输却钗头缥蒂花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8455,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"通州桥下见诀别者","author":"宋褧","text":"二月五日风扬沙，潞阳河津杨柳芽。\n毡车离人泣红颊，摇鞭羡我能还家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8456,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"三月一日杂诗四首（延祐七年） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"仙龙髯堕古混台，碧籞春深花自开。\n踏白马前双斧钺，路人争喜晋王来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8457,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"三月一日杂诗四首（延祐七年） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"苑树云藏绀色鸦，綵楼昏鼓促沉霞。\n分明不似鼕鼕韵，寂寞东风十万家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8458,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"三月一日杂诗四首（延祐七年） 其三","author":"宋褧","text":"柳簇红桥绿雾匀，羽林戈戟锁重闉。\n朝阳空照俜仃影，长似东街碧树身。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8459,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"三月一日杂诗四首（延祐七年） 其四","author":"宋褧","text":"旧时瓮城野樱桃，隈隅弄日晴树高。\n游人来往不能折，烂醉来时玩碧梢。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8460,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"李廷圭墨","author":"宋褧","text":"神物蟠髹麝溲煤，升元曾是进蓬莱。\n玄光依旧能今日，谁信昌言己夜台。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8461,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"阳关图（二首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"系马停车待酒阑，骊驹歌断不成欢。\n凭谁说与图中客，水远山长行路难。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8462,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"阳关图（二首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"前春别宴武陵溪，候馆垂杨暖拂堤。\n忽见画图疑是梦，故人回首洞庭西。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8463,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"七月八日晓晴暂出丽正门外（二首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"团团碧树压宫城，白凤门楣淡日明。\n回首琼华仙岛上，片云犹欲妒新晴。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8464,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"七月八日晓晴暂出丽正门外（二首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"晓凉门巷柳阴蝉，九陌晴泥著锦鞯。\n到处帘栊尽相似，巧棚人静五生蔫。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8465,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"冬夜","author":"宋褧","text":"纸窗如水月如冰，天际浮云罨画屏。\n漏板阑珊参过午，篝灯犹诵太玄经。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8466,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]